title: HelixScope
version: 0.24.3-19
date-released: 2026-10-03
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  Local scientific workstation for DNA, RNA and protein sequence analysis,
  pairwise alignment, motif search, CRISPR guide inspection, variant identity,
  multiple sequence alignment, phylogenetic inference and structure comparison,
  with explicit provenance and without invented scores.
